        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Once we have a marketed product, we will be subject to unannounced inspections by the FDA to determine our compliance with the QSR and other regulations, and these inspections may include the manufacturing facilities of some of our subcontractors.",
        "start_character": 40784,
        "end_character": 41031
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although competitors like Medtronic are expanding the use of transvascular ablation techniques, we are not aware of anyone developing a sensing technology similar in capability to ours.",
        "start_character": 28837,
        "end_character": 29022
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on these findings, we initiated an expansion study (\"PoC 2\") designed to enroll an additional 20 subjects to evaluate the platform in a broader patient population, including other visceral cancer-related pain indications and patients with moderate or earlier-stage pancreatic cancer pain.",
        "start_character": 17259,
        "end_character": 17553
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Despite the significant unmet need, there are relatively few clinical trials worldwide focused on improving pain management for pancreatic cancer patients and we are not aware of any proposed or currently active trials at the location of our proof-of-concept study site.",
        "start_character": 12268,
        "end_character": 12538
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During the fiscal year ended March 31, 2026, we advanced the clinical development program for our platform.",
        "start_character": 16837,
        "end_character": 16944
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Even if our proposed device receives regulatory clearance, there is no guarantee that we will be able to successfully manufacture it at scale.",
        "start_character": 23721,
        "end_character": 23863
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For these reasons, we are initially targeting the treatment of pain associated with pancreatic cancer and have aligned our development and commercialization strategy around this as our first proposed indication for use.",
        "start_character": 10008,
        "end_character": 10227
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Given the palliative nature of this indication, we believe regulatory authorities may be willing to consider more streamlined clinical development pathways with smaller, more focused study designs.",
        "start_character": 12652,
        "end_character": 12849
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The technology we have developed consists of a catheter-based system incorporating a proprietary microchip-enabled sensing architecture designed to detect low-amplitude neural signals from within the vascular system.",
        "start_character": 415,
        "end_character": 631
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a development-stage medical device company focused on advancing technologies for sensing and treating disorders of the nervous system.",
        "start_character": 26,
        "end_character": 167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-018573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-018573-762f2549c8faf1a4",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-018573",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are actively developing a more robust version suitable for clinical and commercial use;",
